  "discordPostHtml": "<p><strong>Almost certainly incompatible with 2.2.0 saves</strong></p><p>Original mod by: Komeiji Satori</p><p>A PL breakaway faction with a varied lineup of ships, weapons, and fighters.</p><p>While Loulan ships cover a wide variety of design philosophies, they all benefit from the same set of \"Tac-Mods\" which provide unique benefits relating to the consumption and/or restoration of the ship's hull level. They also have access to a range of... eccentric weapons.</p><p>[Notable] changes since 2.1.9 (check Changelog_EN file for full):</p><pre><code>Graphicslib dependency replaced with BoxUtil \n\nUNGP rules adjusted/renamed\nChaos Armament renamed \"Chaos Arsenal\" (I think it sounds better)\nCharge Lance (&amp; Integrated version) reworked into \"Chaos Flail\": flux-free(!) but expensive weapon with deeply unreliable output\n\nArc Field hullmod renamed \"Phasebolt Field\" and buffed in various ways\nOther small balance changes</code></pre><p>FORUM THREAD UNDER CONSTRUCTION</p><p><em>Probably</em> save compatible with number-changed older versions</p><p>Download link: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1lOmu5Uuzebv9TSBu9YHkBTsVVvPWv7BX\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1lOmu5Uuzebv9TSBu9YHkBTsVVvPWv7BX</a></p>",
